      "title": {
        "en": "Cozy home-style environment for small dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents overwhelmingly praise Pawsitive Vibes for providing a safe, boutique environment tailored specifically for small dogs. Reviewers describe a loving atmosphere with comfy sofas, soft blankets, and plenty of cuddles where shy, anxious, or reactive pups overcome their fears and socialize happily in small, carefully managed groups."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Loving and devoted pet caregivers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently commend owner Elsi and her team for treating every visiting dog like family. Dog owners highlight her exceptional warmth, patience, and personal attention, citing special touches such as dog birthday celebrations, customized playtime, and thoughtful support during both boarding stays and grooming sessions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Frequent photo updates throughout the day"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently appreciate the outstanding communication provided during daycare and boarding stays. Pet parents mention receiving regular text messages, charming photos, and video clips showing their dogs playing and resting, which gives owners complete peace of mind while at work or traveling out of town."
      }
    }
  ],
